      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_4a27354a",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts two joyful individuals, likely LGBTQ+ allies or participants, celebrating with rainbow flags during a Pride event. The text overlay reads 'gays on their way home after pride weekend,' which is a neutral, celebratory description of a common post-event scenario. There is no toxicity present in the image or text. The scene is positive, inclusive, and conveys a message of community, joy, and pride. The intent is to capture and share a moment of happiness and solidarity associated with LGBTQ+ pride celebrations. No harmful, hateful, abusive, cyberbullying, misogynous, or propagandistic elements are present. The meme serves as a visual documentation of a positive social event without targeting or disparaging any group.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_b36a6748"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
