      "label": "Two women celebrating together at a Pride event",
      "description": "The central scene features two joyful women in the foreground, embracing each other and raising their arms in celebration. One woman holds a rainbow flag, and both are adorned with rainbow-themed accessories, conveying solidarity and happiness. They are positioned centrally, with a blurred crowd and urban background suggesting a public Pride parade or festival setting.",
