      "instance_name": "happiness",
      "label": "joyful emotion",
      "description": "The two women in the foreground are smiling broadly and embracing each other, with their arms raised in celebration. Their facial expressions convey pure joy and contentment, enhanced by the context of a Pride event and the rainbow flag they are holding. This is a clear expression of happiness and solidarity.",
